+    directory (resolved, so a later `..` is judged physically, as the kernel resolves it) only
+    when the WHOLE command is `cd <literal absolute dir> && …` and every later separator is `&&`
+    or a pipe. Any `;`, newline, `||`, `&`, subshell, group or command substitution (a body runs
+    as a separate statement here) keeps the event cwd as a base, as before."""
